# Eikonal Purkinje slab reference values
#
# kind               key     metric          expected            tolerance
#
# Purkinje 1-D eikonal (Dijkstra) activation times at key nodes.
# node0 is the root stimulus (seeded at 0.0 s).
# node8 and node15 are PVJ terminal nodes; their times set the Dirichlet
# constraints that seed the 3-D myocardial eikonal solve.
# These values come from the deterministic Dijkstra solver and should be
# bitwise reproducible across runs.
#
eikonalPurkinjeAT   node0   activationTime   0.0              1e-10
eikonalPurkinjeAT   node8   activationTime   6.82346100e-03   1e-8
eikonalPurkinjeAT   node15  activationTime   8.32345950e-03   1e-8
